# Vercel Web Analytics Implementation Report

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics is **already properly configured** in this Astro project. No changes were required.

## Current Implementation

### Package Installation ✅
- **Package**: `@vercel/analytics` version 2.0.1
- **Location**: Listed in dependencies in `package.json`
- **Package Manager**: pnpm v11.25.0

### Integration ✅
- **File**: `site/src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro`
- **Import**: `import Analytics from "@vercel/analytics/astro";`
- **Placement**: `<Analytics />` component added before closing `</body>` tag
- **Coverage**: All pages use BaseLayout (directly or through ProseLayout), ensuring analytics tracking on all routes

### Framework Compatibility ✅
According to the latest Vercel documentation (fetched from https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart), the implementation follows the recommended approach for Astro projects:
- Using the `@vercel/analytics/astro` import
- Placing the Analytics component in the root layout
- No adapter configuration needed (would only be required if using @astrojs/vercel adapter)

